│ activity, open exact comment in Files, or original      │  │ blockers; r refreshes readiness, l opens lifecycle      │
│ commit; Escape returns                                  │  │ controls                                                │
│ f3/shift+f3: next/previous code search match            │  │ g: choose provider and model, then generate a guide     │
