│ alt+o/n, ctrl+w: full OLD/NEW, whitespace presentation  │  │ R: submit a PR review with pending line comments        │
│ (Files)                                                 │  │ enter: submit inline comment editor                     │
│ alt+up/down: previous/next loaded unresolved thread     │  │ ctrl+o: choose old/new side of split or context rows    │
│ /: find code text in Files or the current Guide section │  │ ctrl+v: start/cancel range; j/k chooses end, enter      │
│ j/k: move the focused list or diff cursor               │  │ composes                                                │
│ up/down: move list selection or scroll continuous diff  │  │ ctrl+s: compose a suggestion from selected right-side   │
│ J/K: scroll diff by 5                                   │  │ lines                                                   │
│ zz: center the focused diff on its line cursor          │  │ ctrl+a: in comment actions, preview and confirm         │
│ h/l, ctrl+h/ctrl+l: focus list/diff                     │  │ suggestion application                                  │
│ enter: focus the diff; open a line editor or selected-  │  │ ctrl+f: compose a file comment (enter posts; queuing    │
